{"text": "MEMORANDUM :\na October 1, 1971 .\nTO: Dr. F. J. Schultz :\nFROM: Willie Settle and Claude Lewis \u00a2)2\n\nSUBJECT: PHENOL ANALYSIS OF MELOY LAB SAMPLES BY INTERNAL\nSTANDARD METHOD MODIFICATION OF KUSHNIR METHOD\n\nThe attached method was a modification of the method\nreported on July 16, 1971. Apparently the inclusion\nof a gas chromatographic internal standard does\nnot improve the precision of the method significantly.\n(Standard deviations 0.63 vs. 0.89)\n\nBoth methods are an adaptation of the method\ndescribed by I. Kushnir, P. A. Barr and 0. T. Chortyk\nAnal. Chemistry 42 1619-21 (1970). The only difference\nin that method is in our use of C-14 phenol and an\ninternal standard.\n\nIt is recommended that a Griffith still be installed\nand a side by side comparison be made of the Oakley\nmethod and the Kushnir method. \u2018The apparent differences\nalready noted between these methods may be due to:\n\n(1) treatment differences - acid - vs. no acid ~ no heat\n(2) age of condensate differences\n(3) systematic error differences\n(4) difficulties associated with acetone-water analyses\n\nWS/CIL/ag\n\n20bT9000", "words": [{"text": "MEMORANDUM", "x0": 330, "y0": 121, "x1": 452, "y1": 132, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": ":", "x0": 722, "y0": 131, "x1": 726, "y1": 135, "conf": 0.0}, {"text": "a", "x0": 369, "y0": 136, "x1": 403, "y1": 151, "conf": 2.0}, {"text": "October", "x0": 503, "y0": 137, "x1": 568, "y1": 148, "conf": 85.0}, {"text": "1,", "x0": 579, "y0": 137, "x1": 586, "y1": 148, "conf": 85.0}, {"text": "1971", "x0": 607, "y0": 137, "x1": 642, "y1": 148, "conf": 91.0}, {"text": ".", "x0": 752, "y0": 137, "x1": 754, "y1": 139, "conf": 0.0}, {"text": "TO:", "x0": 112, "y0": 219, "x1": 141, "y1": 250, "conf": 50.0}, {"text": "Dr.", "x0": 208, "y0": 230, "x1": 233, "y1": 241, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "F.", "x0": 244, "y0": 231, "x1": 260, "y1": 241, "conf": 88.0}, {"text": "J.", "x0": 272, "y0": 231, "x1": 287, "y1": 241, "conf": 88.0}, {"text": "Schultz", "